Description:It is your second main phase. You control Blood Artist and Grizzly Bears; your graveyard holds Dread Return (flashback - sacrifice three creatures) and Gray Merchant of Asphodel. You have Dragon Fodder in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
